e64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T09:35:27-07:00","id":527769,"title":"","content":"Picked up four pins from ebay earlier, the two werewolf ones, the world of darkness, and the white wolf ones. There's quite a few different merch items up atm. including some of the glassware for vampire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6152-grolorm","name":"Grolorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T14:39:10-07:00","id":532301,"title":"","content":"Does anyone remember the Hunter the Reckoning street team promotion? I seem to recall tiers of rewards with wall scrolls and mugs and such. Curious what happened with that (if anyone got rewards etc).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5952-majicou83","name":"Majicou83","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T07:58:00-07:00","id":565411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/35993-merchandise?p=432119#post432119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And secondly, I've been looking for one of these for ages and finally found a picture. Does anyone own one of these pendants? Can you post pics of it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I owned one of the Klaive necklaces. While it was small, it wasn't &quot;WW Tribe Necklace small,&quot; and its solid thickness gave it a weight that kept you mindful that you were wearing it, but not heavy enough to thump impractically against your throat/chest when you ran or jumped. No pix, sadly, as I'm pretty sure the GF half of an overnight guest couple succumbed to temptation and lifted it in 2003. 9/10, would wear again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T08:03:16-07:00","id":565416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Majicou83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/35993-merchandise?p=507255#post507255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Too much?</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, you tell me. Of course, you should probably wait until I recover from the &gt;BZZZT!&lt; paddle-thingies that I had to use on myself...you know, because your picture <i>caused my frickin' <b>heart</b> to<br /> seize.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1536,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","user":"39Steps","date":". 06-23-2015, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-27T14:46:43-07:00","id":570615,"title":"","content":"There are a few more non-vamp lapel pins up on ebay again, the werewolf, WoD, and WW paw. In case anyone is collecting them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6152-grolorm","name":"Grolorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T02:30:26-08:00","id":781037,"title":"","content":"I'm looking for complete my dice set collection, anyone knows how many set exist? The only missing set in my collection is the werewolf dice set second edition and some boxes.<br /> <br /> My dice set collection so far is:<br /> Vampire the masquerade 3 versions<br /> Vampire the Dark Ages<br /> DArk Ages Vampire<br /> Werewolf the Apocalypse 2 version.<br /> Mage the Ascencion 2 versions<br /> Wraith the Oblivion<br /> Changeling the Dreaming<br /> Demon the fallen<br /> Hunter The Reckoning<br /> Time of Judgment<br /> All NWoD<br /> 2 sets of Exalted<br /> Aberrant<br /> Trinity.<br /> <br /> Also I have:<br /> <br /> 3 Mage Tarots (2 MtAs 1 MtAw)<br /> Werewolf Poker DEck<br /> Klaive<br /> Cantrip Cards full set (also have some several duplicates)<br /> Time of Judgment clock<br /> Vampire blood Point<br /> I still have some pins<br /> Changeling Window cling<br /> Some posters<br /> <br /> Anyone can share the picture of the Werewolf the apocalypse dice set second edition please?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3159-axlfairus","name":"axlfairus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-15T00:27:08-08:00","id":786558,"title":"","content":"There's <a href=\"http://www.ebay.com/cln/noeukaryote/werewolf/259199284011\" target=\"_blank\">some W:tA stuff on eBay</a> right now for those who might be interested. All too rich for my blood, but figured I'd share in case someone has been waiting for one of these.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/